.TP
.B \&unfreeze
\&Lift persistent package version constraints
.TP
.B \&install
\&Install one or more packages, optionally specifying publisher and version
.TP
.B \&autoremove
\&Remove dependencies no longer needed by explicitly installed packages
.TP
